    "updated_at": "2021-10-01T13:59:57Z",
    "body": "It has nothing to do using tensor core or not.\r\n\r\nIt is hard to run two short kernels in parallel in two different streams.  The kernel launch overhead is not small and it is possible that when the 2nd kernel is launched, the 1st one is done.  A100 is much faster than V100 which makes the kernel runtime much shorter and it is more difficult to run two short kernels in parallel.",
